{"event_id": "event_wenjie_001", "step": 8, "agent_id": "agent_1442246695", "state": {"current_emotion": "neutral", "official_attitude": "question", "will_comment": true, "last_action": "comment", "last_comment_faction": "观点输出派", "last_comment_id": "comment_042", "last_comment": {"comment_id": "comment_042", "text": "华为和赛力斯合作，技术下放到儿童车，看似跨界，实则品牌营销。但儿童车是否真需要那么多智能功能，得看实际需求。", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 1}}}
